Continuous push supports only these three target types.

This parameter is required.', example='DEVICE'),
  targetValue?: string(name='TargetValue', description='Specify values based on Target. Separate multiple values with commas. If you exceed the limit, split the push into multiple calls.

- Target=DEVICE: values such as `deviceid1,deviceid2` (up to 1,000 supported).

- Target=ACCOUNT: values such as `account1,account2` (up to 1,000 supported).

- Target=ALIAS: values such as `alias1,alias2` (up to 1,000 supported).

This parameter is required.', example='a692961a92534047ad3625****'),
}

